    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements the vendor-neutral ASP dispatch layer of the SFL library. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Vendor-neutral Advanced Sector Protection (ASP) dispatch layer of the serial flash library (SFL). Responsibilities:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Expose all public XSfl_Flash* ASP APIs (vendor-neutral wrappers that delegate to the ops table bound during XSfl_FlashInit).</para></listitem><listitem><para>Provide the shared helpers (sector range validation, password unlock) used by the XSfl_Asp* operations in <ref refid="xilsfl_8c" kindref="compound">xilsfl.c</ref>.</para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para><para>Vendor binding and the XSfl_Asp* operation entry points live in <ref refid="xilsfl_8c" kindref="compound">xilsfl.c</ref>. Adding a new vendor requires only a new vendor.c / vendor.h pair that exports an XSfl_AspVendorOps table, plus one entry in XSfl_FlashAspAssignVendorOps.</para><para><preformatted>
MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted>Ver   Who Date     Changes
<hruler/>

1.3   sb  07/20/26  Initial support for Advanced Sector Protection.
1.4   vn  09/30/26  Align Doxygen comments with AMD standards</preformatted></para><para><preformatted></preformatted> </para>    </detaileddescription>
